            <div xml:id="d35">

                <pb facs="0120" n="38" sameAs="frus:frus1911/pg38"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 425.11A78/582.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The American Ambassador to Great Britain to the
                        Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Embassy</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >London</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1911-07-11"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">July 11, 1911</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 1738.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Referring to my telegram concerning my
                    receipt to-day at the foreign office of His Majesty’s decision and award in the
                    Alsop case, I hasten to forward the original of this decision and award as
                    executed in triplicate. Another of the originals was handed in my presence
                    simultaneously to Mr. Edwards, the Chilean minister. As stated in the telegram,
                    the award is for 2,275,375 bolivianos; and the claim of the United States that
                    the value of the original debt, with interest, should be calculated in gold is”
                    denied.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Whitelaw Reid.</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d35-a1.xml" xpointer="d35-a1"/>
            </div>
